---
/**
 * Two-party Pacto Gov loop: captain ↔ crew with proposals and mutiny.
 */
---

<figure class="concept-diagram" aria-labelledby="two-party-caption">
  <div
    class="two-party"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Captain picks the crew. Captain and crew can both make proposals. Crew votes by quorum. Captain can approve or veto. Crew can mutiny the captain."
  >
    <div class="two-party-roles">
      <div class="party-box party-box--captain">
        <span class="party-box-name">Captain</span>
        <span class="party-box-hint">Founder / leader</span>
      </div>
      <div class="party-box party-box--crew">
        <span class="party-box-name">Crew</span>
        <span class="party-box-hint">Contributors</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="two-party-edges">
      <li>
        <span class="edge-from">Captain</span>{' '}picks the{' '}
        <span class="edge-to">crew</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="edge-from">Captain</span>{' '}and{' '}
        <span class="edge-from">crew</span>{' '}can both make{' '}
        <span class="edge-to">proposals</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="edge-from">Crew</span>{' '}votes by quorum on{' '}
        <span class="edge-to">proposals / treasury</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="edge-from">Captain</span>{' '}can{' '}
        <span class="edge-to">approve or veto</span>
      </li>
      <li class="two-party-edges-mutiny">
        <span class="edge-from">Crew</span>{' '}can{' '}
        <strong class="edge-mutiny">mutiny</strong>{' '}the{' '}
        <span class="edge-to">captain</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="two-party-result">
      <span class="two-party-result-label">Leadership stays provisional</span>
      <span class="two-party-result-body">
        Early stage needs a captain. When the community outgrows that, mutiny is how power evolves —
        not a locked-in founder forever.
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="two-party-caption" class="concept-diagram-caption">
    A two-party system inside one Hats tree: crew and captain check each other. Mutiny is the escape
    hatch when entrenched leadership no longer fits.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
